msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/class-bgcouriers-wc-settings.php:575
msgid "Auto-generate labels"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/class-bgcouriers-wc-settings.php:576
msgid "Automatically generate a shipping label when an order reaches the status below."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/class-bgcouriers-wc-settings.php:577
msgid "Trigger status"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/class-bgcouriers-wc-settings.php:580
msgid "Share customer email with courier"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/class-bgcouriers-wc-settings.php:581
msgid "Put the customer’s e-mail on the shipment for courier notifications, when provided."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/class-bgcouriers-wc-settings.php:583
msgid "Re-issue the waybill when the order changes"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/class-bgcouriers-wc-settings.php:584
msgid "If an order that already has a waybill is edited in a way the courier needs to know about - the delivery address, the contents, the weight or the amount to collect - void it and issue a new one automatically. Edits that do not affect the shipment (status, notes) never trigger it."
